@20101 = ~Cloud of Bestial Frenzy~
@20102 = ~Liptzitn, Lord of the 618th~
@20103 = ~You notice that the hands on this stone clock are detached from the rest of the mechanism. Perhaps, by forcing them, you could reposition them. For now, they indicate 9:00. What time would you like to set the hands to?~
@2010850 = ~8:50.~
@2010851 = ~8:51.~
@2010852 = ~8:52.~
@2010853 = ~8:53.~
@2010854 = ~8:54.~
@2010855 = ~8:55.~
@2010856 = ~8:56.~
