@2010909 = ~9:09.~
@2010910 = ~9:10.~
@2010912 = ~Force the hands to 9:12.~ //requires 21 Strength
@20109129 = ~You cannot manage it; you would need more strength.~
@20104 = ~Do not touch the hands.~
@20105 = ~You move the hands, and once they are set where you wanted them, you hear a small "click." You do not know what it means. To check, you try to move the hands again, but this time they refuse to budge.~
@20106 = ~You notice that the hands on this stone clock are detached from the rest of the mechanism. Perhaps, by forcing them, you could reposition them. For now, they indicate 1:00. What time would you like to set the hands to?~
@2010050 = ~0:50.~
