@201060 = ~You notice that the hands on this stone clock are detached from the rest of the mechanism. Perhaps, by forcing them, you could reposition them. For now, they indicate 2:00. What time would you like to set the hands to?~
@2010150 = ~1:50.~
@2010151 = ~1:51.~
@2010152 = ~1:52.~
@2010153 = ~1:53.~
