@2010210 = ~2:10.~
@20107 = ~The hands do not move despite your efforts. Perhaps it would work with more strength?~ //requires 19 Strength by default
@20108 = ~Who is destroying my toys?~
@20109 = ~Who is going to die for that?~
@20110 = ~Who am I? Do you have the slightest idea?~
@20111 = ~Who do you think promotes the Demon Lords?~
@20112 = ~Who stands beyond even the scale of rank?~
@20113 = ~Who is the Alpha and the Omega?~
@20114 = ~Who is Evil, who is Absolute, who is Absolute Evil?~
@20115 = ~The hands made a "click" after you moved them. Now they can no longer be moved.~
@20116 = ~Portal to the Pasture~
@20117 = ~You cannot see the bottom of this well.~
@20118 = ~This device vibrates with energy.~
@20119 = ~Each of its spheres allows you to see another plane. The planes you can see are sometimes demonic, other times angelic.~
@20120 = ~This structure vibrates with magic. Somehow, you sense that it is connected to the surrounding spheres.~
@20121 = ~At the bottom of this device, you see the desiccated corpse of a baby bariaur.~
@20122 = ~Adventurers, welcome. When Telim'Gar offered me the chance to take charge of one of his arenas, I never thought I would enjoy myself this much. I saw you arrive, you know? I do not possess my host's omnipotence, but I have these spheres that allow me to see everywhere. In anticipation of your arrival, I set up a whole bunch of "surprise traps." Did you like them? And the mists, do you like those? It took me a long time to set all this up, you know. Because it is amusing to watch you suffer. Besides, if you are still alive, it means you have not suffered enough. I am going to remedy that. Come to me, my toys!~
@20123 = ~HAAAAAAA....... It feels so good to regain control of my body.... This mortal's subconscious fought for a long time, but I finally won... It is time to pick up where we left off....~
@2012499 = ~Well, well, we meet again... If you are here, it means you do not know how to listen to good advice. Well, all the better; it gives me another opportunity to make you scream in pain...~
